### Create feature request
POST http://localhost:8085/api/v1/feature-requests
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 3fddf7d6-2b26-4ace-b628-9d5e5e220001
X-User-Role: USER

{
  "title": "Add AI recap",
  "description": "Weekly AI summary of workouts and mood",
  "category": "AI",
  "platformTarget": "android",
  "moduleKey": "coach"
}

### Vote feature request (replace id)
POST http://localhost:8085/api/v1/feature-requests/{{featureId}}/vote
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 3fddf7d6-2b26-4ace-b628-9d5e5e220002
X-User-Role: USER

{
  "voteType": "UP"
}

### Create feedback review
POST http://localhost:8085/api/v1/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 3fddf7d6-2b26-4ace-b628-9d5e5e220003
X-User-Role: USER

{
  "type": "REVIEW",
  "title": "Onboarding",
